From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: iwls <iwls@localhost>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 15:21:47 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Archive: zip/7z extractor for importing Windows programs

MadeiraArchive.c extracts .zip (zlib) and .7z (7-Zip's public-domain C
decoder, vendored in Archive/lzma) into a folder, streaming every 7z block
layout 7-Zip writes by default (LZMA, LZMA2, BCJ, BCJ2, branch filters,
Delta) so memory does not grow with the archive. Zip names without the
UTF-8 flag fall back to GB18030, entries cannot escape the destination,
and encrypted archives are reported as such.
